  "description": "<h4 data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"185\">Welcome to <strong data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"229\">Budelas &ndash; Canada&rsquo;s Sustainable Marketplace!</strong> 🇨🇦 We specialize in <strong data-end=\"370\" data-start=\"299\">premium health-oriented goods and sustainable products</strong>, all sourced from trusted <strong data-end=\"416\" data-start=\"397\">Canadian brands</strong>. Support local, shop sustainably, and nourish your health with Budelas!</h4>\r\n<hr data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"492\">\r\n<p data-end=\"819\" data-start=\"532\">We offer a curated selection of <strong data-end=\"592\" data-start=\"564\">Canadian health products</strong>, including:<br data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"604\">✅ <strong data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"609\">Nutrient-rich dry goods</strong> (organic grains, superfoods, and wellness products)<br data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"755\">✅ <strong data-end=\"781\" data-start=\"760\">Sustainable goods</strong> that support a healthy lifestyle 🌍</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"821\">Shop online at <strong data-end=\"859\" data-start=\"836\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"838\">www.Budelas.ca</a></strong> or visit us at our farmstand!</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"893\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"940\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"943\">100% Canadian Brands</strong> &ndash; We support local businesses across Canada!<br data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"1012\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"1018\">Sustainable &amp; Health-Focused</strong> &ndash; Every product is chosen with wellness in mind.<br data-end=\"1102\" data-start=\"1099\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"1128\" data-start=\"1105\">Nationwide Shipping</strong> &ndash; Fast &amp; reliable shipping across Canada.<br data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1170\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"1207\" data-start=\"1176\">Affiliate Program Available</strong> &ndash; Earn while sharing Budelas with your audience!</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1260\">\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1292\" data-start=\"1265\"><strong data-end=\"1290\" data-start=\"1270\">💰 Payment Terms</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1293\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1374\" data-start=\"1293\"><strong data-end=\"1313\" data-start=\"1295\">Online orders:</strong> Secure checkout via <strong data-end=\"1372\" data-start=\"1334\">Credit Card, PayPal, and multiple other options listed on the site</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1437\" data-start=\"1375\"><strong data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1377\">Farmstand pickups:</strong> Cash, Debit, or E-transfer accepted</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1507\" data-start=\"1438\"><strong data-end=\"1455\" data-start=\"1440\">Free pickup</strong> available at <strong data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1469\">our local retail outlet, pick up times will be presented via email when the order is ready.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1508\"><strong data-end=\"1536\" data-start=\"1510\">Shipping across Canada</strong> (free for orders $100+)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1567\" data-start=\"1564\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1868\" data-start=\"1601\"><strong data-end=\"1665\" data-start=\"1644\"></strong><br data-end=\"1668\" data-start=\"1665\">📦 <strong data-end=\"1689\" data-start=\"1671\">Refund Policy:</strong> Full refund if out of stock or delayed shipping<br data-end=\"1809\" data-start=\"1806\">📩 <strong data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1812\">Contact Us:</strong> DM us or visit <strong data-end=\"1866\" data-start=\"1843\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" data-end=\"1864\" data-start=\"1845\">www.Budelas.ca</a></strong></p>",
