  "term_and_condition": "<h2 data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"196\"><strong data-end=\"267\" data-start=\"199\">Conditions</strong></h2>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"300\" data-start=\"271\"><strong data-end=\"298\" data-start=\"275\">1. Program Overview</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"510\" data-start=\"301\">The <strong data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"305\">Budelas Healthy Living Affiliate Program</strong> rewards affiliates for promoting <strong data-end=\"413\" data-start=\"383\">Canadian wellness products</strong>. Earn commissions, share exclusive discounts, and help grow a sustainable future with Budelas.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"581\" data-start=\"512\">By joining, affiliates agree to the following terms and conditions.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"583\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"588\"><strong data-end=\"612\" data-start=\"592\">2. Who Can Join?</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"615\">✔️ Bloggers, influencers, and content creators in <strong data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"665\">health, wellness, and gardening</strong>.<br data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"701\">✔️ Businesses and professionals looking to expand their revenue streams.<br data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"776\">✔️ Social media marketers with <strong data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"810\">engaged audiences</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"836\">🚫 <strong data-end=\"855\" data-start=\"839\">Not Allowed:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"858\">\r\n<li data-end=\"886\" data-start=\"858\">Coupon or deal websites.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"950\" data-start=\"887\">Misleading advertising or unauthorized discount promotions.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"951\">Paid ads using \"Budelas\" as a keyword without permission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1017\" data-start=\"1014\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1019\"><strong data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"1023\">3. Commission &amp; Payouts</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1120\" data-start=\"1053\">Earn up to <strong data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1064\">12% commission per sale</strong> based on your performance!</p>\r\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\r\n<thead data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1122\">\r\n<tr data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1122\">\r\n<th data-end=\"1133\" data-start=\"1122\"><strong data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1124\">Tier</strong></th>\r\n<th data-end=\"1153\" data-start=\"1133\"><strong data-end=\"1152\" data-start=\"1135\">Monthly Sales</strong></th>\r\n<th data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1153\"><strong data-end=\"1174\" data-start=\"1155\">Commission Rate</strong></th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-end=\"1351\" data-start=\"1227\">\r\n<tr data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1227\">\r\n<td><strong data-end=\"1240\" data-start=\"1229\">Starter</strong></td>\r\n<td>Up to $500</td>\r\n<td><strong data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1256\">10%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-end=\"1310\" data-start=\"1268\">\r\n<td><strong data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1270\">Growth</strong></td>\r\n<td>$501 - $2,000</td>\r\n<td><strong data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1299\">11%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-end=\"1351\" data-start=\"1311\">\r\n<td><strong data-end=\"1322\" data-start=\"1313\">Elite</strong></td>\r\n<td>Above $2,000</td>\r\n<td><strong data-end=\"1347\" data-start=\"1340\">12%</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p data-end=\"1449\" data-start=\"1353\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1356\">Affiliate Discount Code:</strong> Receive a unique <strong data-end=\"1418\" data-start=\"1402\">10% off code</strong> to share with your audience.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1451\">💰 <strong data-end=\"1473\" data-start=\"1454\">Payout Details:</strong><br data-end=\"1476\" data-start=\"1473\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"1508\" data-start=\"1479\">Minimum payout threshold:</strong> $50<br data-end=\"1515\" data-start=\"1512\">✔️ Paid via <strong data-end=\"1541\" data-start=\"1527\">E-transfer</strong> within the first <strong data-end=\"1579\" data-start=\"1559\">10 business days</strong> of each month.<br data-end=\"1597\" data-start=\"1594\">✔️ Commissions do <strong data-end=\"1622\" data-start=\"1615\">not</strong> apply to taxes, shipping, or refunded orders.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1675\" data-start=\"1672\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1710\" data-start=\"1677\"><strong data-end=\"1708\" data-start=\"1681\">4. Affiliate Guidelines</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1924\" data-start=\"1711\">✔️ Use only <strong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1723\">approved Budelas product images</strong> and marketing materials.<br data-end=\"1786\" data-start=\"1783\">✔️ Maintain an <strong data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1801\">active online presence</strong> (social media, website, or blog).<br data-end=\"1864\" data-start=\"1861\">✔️ Follow <strong data-end=\"1911\" data-start=\"1874\">ethical and responsible marketing</strong> practices.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1954\" data-start=\"1926\">🚫 <strong data-end=\"1952\" data-start=\"1929\">Prohibited Actions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2117\" data-start=\"1955\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1998\" data-start=\"1955\">Misleading claims or false advertising.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2059\" data-start=\"1999\">Editing product images to <strong data-end=\"2056\" data-start=\"2027\">alter branding or pricing</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2117\" data-start=\"2060\">Spamming, fake referrals, or any fraudulent activity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"2122\" data-start=\"2119\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2169\" data-start=\"2124\"><strong data-end=\"2167\" data-start=\"2128\">5. Use of Product Images &amp; Branding</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2170\">📷 <strong data-end=\"2227\" data-start=\"2173\">Affiliates may use official Budelas product images</strong> for promotions.<br data-end=\"2246\" data-start=\"2243\">📁 A <strong data-end=\"2271\" data-start=\"2251\">dedicated folder</strong> (Google Drive/Dropbox) with high-quality images is available.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2358\" data-start=\"2337\">🚫 <strong data-end=\"2356\" data-start=\"2340\">Not Allowed:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2453\" data-start=\"2359\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2411\" data-start=\"2359\">Using non-Budelas images or third-party content.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2453\" data-start=\"2412\">Modifying images in a misleading way.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2455\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2492\" data-start=\"2460\"><strong data-end=\"2490\" data-start=\"2464\">6. Program Termination</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"2583\" data-start=\"2493\">Budelas reserves the right to <strong data-end=\"2546\" data-start=\"2523\">modify or terminate</strong> the affiliate program at any time.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2817\" data-start=\"2585\">✔️ Affiliates will receive a <strong data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2614\">30-day notice</strong> before program closure.<br data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2655\">✔️ Final commissions will be paid if the <strong data-end=\"2727\" data-start=\"2699\">minimum payout threshold</strong> is met.<br data-end=\"2738\" data-start=\"2735\">✔️ Affiliate links &amp; discount codes will be <strong data-end=\"2814\" data-start=\"2782\">deactivated upon termination</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2920\" data-start=\"2819\">🚫 <strong data-end=\"2847\" data-start=\"2822\">Immediate termination</strong> for affiliates who violate these terms, including fraudulent activity.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"2925\" data-start=\"2922\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2971\" data-start=\"2927\"><strong data-end=\"2969\" data-start=\"2931\">7. Agreement &amp; Contact Information</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"3086\" data-start=\"2972\">By applying and participating in the <strong data-end=\"3053\" data-start=\"3009\">Budelas Healthy Living Affiliate Program</strong>, you <strong data-end=\"3083\" data-start=\"3059\">agree to these terms</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"3141\" data-start=\"3088\">📩 <strong data-end=\"3105\" data-start=\"3091\">Questions?</strong> Contact us at <strong data-end=\"3138\" data-start=\"3120\">Budelasfarmstand@gmail.com</strong></p>",
